Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Add live in-progress trip km/time readout to driver Home
 screen

Reads the local auto-trip state (AsyncStorage, written by the background
location task) so distance and elapsed time for the trip in progress show
up immediately, instead of only appearing once the trip ends and
vehicle_trips.distance_km is written.
